Lab 4: Deploy and Manage Policies Across Clusters with RHACM
Lab Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Understand the fundamentals of Red Hat Advanced Cluster Management (RHACM) policy framework
Define and deploy pod security policies across multiple OpenShift clusters
Apply resource quotas consistently across managed clusters
Ensure security policy compliance and consistency in a multi-cluster environment
Monitor and troubleshoot policy violations across your cluster fleet
Implement governance best practices using open-source tools
